LOCATION:Goodnights Comedy Club\, 401 Woodburn Rd.\, Raleigh
DESCRIPTION:Joe Nunnink is a comedian\, writer\, and content creator based 
 in New York City. Originally from Kansas City\, Joe won over audiences with
  his accessible yet absurd brand of stand-up. Joe has performed at comedy f
 estivals all over the country including the Boston Comedy Festival and the 
 New York Comedy Festival\, where he was selected as a 2023 official “Crea
 tor to Watch.” His online comedy sketches have been written about in Vult
 ure Magazine\, and he has written for the popular YouTuber\, MeatCanyon. Jo
 e has opened for comedians such Shane Gillis\, Andy Dick and Craig Conant.\
 n\nHis debut stand up special\, Keep the Change\, distributed by 800lb Gori
 lla\, is available on YouTube.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent 
